BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Apex Intelligence Connections Circle
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260528T050000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260528T060000
UID:1e62089beb76d9e806109147128ca652@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Come join us for this Apex Chamber of Commerce Connections Cir
 cle to network and discuss the business of AI. Our speaker will be Alex Th
 omas. Alex Thomas is a software consultant at Applied Visions (AVI)\, wher
 e he helps businesses use AI to improve everyday operations. His focus is 
 on practical applications — automating repetitive work\, improving custo
 mer experiences\, and helping teams get more done with the tools they alre
 ady use. He helps make AI approachable and useful for businesses of all si
 zes\, not just large tech companies. He will present on AI Agents followed
  by round table discussions.
LOCATION:Apex\, NC
URL:https://business.apexchamber.com/events/details/apex-intelligence-conn
 ections-circle
X-SOURCE:Apex Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
